<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>b=(3*(Theta-RotationAngle)*pi/180)*exp(-j*(Theta)*pi/180);&#x000D;&#x000A;a=sin(3*(Theta-RotationAngle)*pi/180);&#x000D;&#x000A;if a==0 &amp;&amp; b==0 x=abs((exp(j*Theta*pi/180))); else x=abs(a/b); end;</Text>
